# Force LF in the repository regardless of the platform checking out.
#
# Not cosmetics: deploy/run.sh, deploy/termux/diagram-mcp-ctl and
# deploy/termux/diagram-mcp-guard are executed by bash on Android/Termux. A
# CRLF line ending there is not "ugly", it makes the kernel resolve the shebang
# to `/usr/bin/bash\r` and the script dies with "bad interpreter: no such file
# or directory" — which looks nothing like a line-ending bug. Windows defaults
# to autocrlf=true, which would otherwise smuggle CRLF in on the next commit.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary or generated-in-place assets: never rewrite.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.html text eol=lf
